##  Coaching Checklist for SAFe Transformation

For oaching sessions to verify full visual alignment:

- [ ] **Are Sprint Goals visible during every Daily Sync without switching screens?**
- [ ] **Can team members identify blocked items within 3 seconds of looking at the board?**
- [ ] **Are Team PI Objectives accessible and known by all team members (not just the PO)?**
- [ ] **Is the Definition of Done explicitly checked before moving any story to `Done`?**
- [ ] **Are Retrospective Action Items placed directly into the Sprint Backlog as actionable stories?**
- [ ] **Is Flow Efficiency / Cycle Time reviewed openly in every Iteration Retrospective?**

---

## Pro-Tip for Agile Coaching

> **"If an artifact isn't visible during daily work, it doesn't exist."**  
> Don't let PI Objectives or DoD sit in closed PDF files or hidden folders. Embed live links, Jira gadgets, and automated Slack/Teams bots to bring data directly into the team's daily workspace!
